<p class="lede">
Georgia control number 24062142 appears in this archive under the name "Abebe Caesar Ventures, LLC". A registry mirror now lists the same number under the name "Renewal Development Group LLC". This page sets out what the records say, what each side says, and what is still open. It draws no conclusion.
</p>

<div class="notice-box">
        <strong>Update, October 7, 2026:</strong>
        After this page was first published, this archive obtained a copy of
        a May 2026 order of the Superior Court of Fulton County in Abebe
        Caesar Ventures, LLC v. Mekonnen Abebe and three other companies,
        Civil Action File No. 26CV006560. The searches listed below did not
        find that case; the county's trial portal refused every request. See
        <a href="/reports/fulton-court-order">Fulton County Judge Orders Abebe to Transfer Properties to Abebe Caesar Ventures</a>.
        The rest of this page is unchanged.
      </div>

      <div class="notice-box">
<strong>Scope:</strong>
The registry lines below come from OpenCorporates, a mirror of the Georgia Secretary of State's data. The state's own business search refused every request (HTTP 403, bot check), so the state's own record was not read. The county owner field comes from a parcel layer, not the deed index. A search that finds nothing means only that no case was found in that place, with that query, on that date.
</div>

<h2>What the Record Says</h2>

<h3>The site's earlier list</h3>

<p>The site's earlier list of Georgia entities, on the report <a href="/reports/mike-abebe" target="_blank">Mike Abebe &amp; Abebe Ventures</a>, has this entry: name "Abebe Caesar Ventures, LLC"; control number "24062142"; type "Domestic Limited Liability Company"; principal office "249 Milton Ave SE, Atlanta, GA 30315, USA"; registered agent "Universal Registered Agents, Inc."; status "Active/Owes Current Year AR". This is the site's own earlier capture, made before October 2026. It was not re-read at the state's registry.</p>

