<p>The site's earlier list and the mirror show the same control number, the same address and the same registered agent. No page opened prints the earlier name. The two officers the mirror lists were not read, and what they are (an organizer, an officer of record, the registered agent, or something else) is unknown. Who signed the June 15, 2026 name change, and who the members are, is not shown by any page opened.</p>

<p>The mirror types the company a Georgia domestic LLC with the filing line "25 Mar 2024 Business Formation". A name search for "renewal development group" in Georgia on the mirror returned this one company.</p>

<h3>The Atlanta rezoning file</h3>

<p>Atlanta City Council legislation file 26-O-1039 (<a href="https://atlantacityga.iqm2.com/Citizens/Detail_LegiFile.aspx?Frame=&amp;MeetingID=4412&amp;MediaPosition=10908.000&amp;ID=39449&amp;CssClass=" target="_blank">file page</a>) carries this caption: "... AREA: 13.87 ACRES ... OWNER: ABEBE CAESAR VENTURES, LLC.; APPLICANT: MEKONNEN ABEBE; NPU X COUNCIL DISTRICT 12". The file page reads "ADOPTED BY A ROLL CALL VOTE OF 14 YEAS; 0 NAYS". The ordinance printout's history reads "ADOPTED BY CONSENT VOTE [14 TO 0]" (the source checker's read). Both are dated June 15, 2026, and both show 14 to 0; the two descriptions are reported as printed.</p>

<p>The word "Renewal" does not occur in the file page or in the ordinance printout. The printout is marked last updated June 11, 2026. No earlier 2025 file was found by the research, so whether the caption changed over time is unknown. Nothing in the file shows a change of applicant.</p>

<p>The city's online permit portal, as read October 7, 2026, prints for record Z-25-001: "Applicant: Individual Mekonnen Abebe 249 Milton Avenue Atlanta, GA, 30315"; on the companion filing, "Mekonnen Abebe Abebe Caesar Ventures, LLC 249 Milton Avenue". The portal's status for Z-25-001 reads "Revisions Required-See Comment". The city's planning layer, as of August 5, 2026, reads "STATUS: COMPLETE" with "ORDINANCE: 26-O-1039"; that layer names no applicant or owner. No portal record opened names Renewal Development Group. Only the first 10 of 29 records on the main parcel can be read without a form, so this means "not on the pages read".</p>

