<p>The layer prints the name "ABEBE CAESAR VENTURES LLC" on one of the five parcels, three other LLC names on the other four, and no individual's name on any of the five.</p>

<p>The source ran a count over the whole county layer of 373,306 parcels for an owner field containing "RENEWAL DEVELOPMENT" or beginning "RENEWAL " and found 0. That test cannot show an owner under another name, an affiliate, or who benefits from ownership. For the "approximately 45 additional acres" in Renewal's release, it shows only that no owner named "Renewal Development" appears in this layer on that date.</p>

<p>Earlier layers print a different owner on 1313 Sylvan Rd SW: ABEBE SANDY VENTURES LLC in the 2019, 2020, 2021 and 2023 layers (no 2022 layer is published), ABEBE AVON VENTURES LLC in 2024, and ABEBE CAESAR VENTURES LLC in 2025 and 2026. The dates, prices and instruments behind each change of name are in the deed index, not in the layer.</p>

<p>The registry mirror's name and the county's owner field are different records, kept by different offices and updated by different processes. Neither is a title history.</p>

