<p>The city's permit portal read "Revisions Required-See Comment" for Z-25-001 on October 7, 2026, while the city's rezoning layer read "STATUS: COMPLETE" on August 5, 2026 and the council file shows adoption on June 15, 2026. Which date does each status reflect?</p>
